# that reads as one — see PUBLIC_HEX in code/backend/tests/test_cc_folders.py, which also carries an
# inline `gitleaks:allow` so the live line cannot fire again. gitleaks scans a pull request's
# commits, not just its final tree, so fixing the line could not retire these two.
